<!-- awf:section dispatch -->
## Dispatch

Construct one self-contained task per child. When multiple independent information needs exist, fan them out as sibling calls instead of broadening one child's task. Select breadth, detail, and tier independently per child; for example, combine a large analysis child with small targeted paths or summary children. Only refinements that depend on an earlier result stay sequential. {{ if .targetSubagentTools }}Call `subagent_explore` for each child with required task, breadth, and detail. Pi runs at most ten exploration children and queues the rest FIFO. Choose the smallest reliable tier - `small` (narrow, mechanical), `standard` (substantive but bounded), or `large` (broad, intricate, cross-cutting, or high-consequence) - escalating after uncertainty, failed reasoning, or widened scope; omit the `model` field to use configured role routing, overriding deliberately with the tier's exact `provider/model-id`. Never pass `default`, `auto`, or `inherit parent` as a model value. Full tier definitions: docs/workflow.md.{{ else }}Dispatch each child through the `explorer` agent as a target-native fresh-context exploration subagent, providing its task, breadth, and detail; the agent's own contract carries the boundary, outcome, and report rules. Choose the smallest reliable tier per child - `small` (narrow, mechanical), `standard` (substantive but bounded), or `large` (broad, intricate, cross-cutting, or high-consequence) - escalating after uncertainty, failed reasoning, or widened scope; select the smallest reliable target-native model explicitly, or use the harness default and note in the dispatch brief that explicit selection is unavailable. Full tier definitions: docs/workflow.md.{{ end }}
<!-- awf:end -->

<!-- awf:section results -->
## Results

Ground every material claim with file/line evidence. A not-found result must begin exactly `Not found within <breadth> boundary: <what was searched>` and is successful execution. It may suggest one concise next refinement. A broad absence report must name the project search universe and searched surfaces. Distinguish inconclusive and unverified outcomes from absence. Consume only relevant final findings.

After not-found, inconclusive, unverified, or insufficient output, the parent may make a new fresh-context call to correct the task, change report detail, or widen breadth.
<!-- awf:end -->

<!-- awf:section boundaries -->
## Boundaries

This support path never creates an effort. When a parent effort exists, its slug and owned memory path are read-only context; never create a second effort, become a second writer, or edit shared memory. This skill is report-only. Validate the fixed identity and exact `.awf/efforts/<slug>/memory.md` path when supplied; {{if eq .profile "core"}}project documentation, source, tests, and repository history{{else}}repository and current-state authority{{end}} outrank checkpoint prose. Standalone memory is forbidden. Never edit files, commit, recursively delegate, widen past the selected maximum, bundle an unrelated need, or retain state.
<!-- awf:end -->

